### Run `npm run watch` first. Post the purchase in this order.
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/postGoodsReceipt
Content-Type: application/json

< ./goods-receipt.json

### Supplier invoice, 50 pieces at 8.20
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/postInvoiceReceipt
Content-Type: application/json

< ./invoice-receipt.json

### Payment of the invoice document 100000002
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/payVendor
Content-Type: application/json

< ./pay-vendor.json

### Clear GR/IR and the supplier account
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/clearOpenItems
Content-Type: application/json

< ./clear-gr-ir.json

###
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/clearOpenItems
Content-Type: application/json

< ./clear-suppliers.json

### Sale of 40 pieces: goods issue and billing document
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/postSale
Content-Type: application/json

< ./sale.json

### Customer payment, then clear the customer account
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/receiveCustomerPayment
Content-Type: application/json

< ./customer-payment.json

###
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/clearOpenItems
Content-Type: application/json

< ./clear-customers.json

### The balance of every account, and what is still open
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/AccountBalances

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger-postings/OpenItems
